      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"},
      "widgets_values": ["[Shot 1] The opening frame presents a medium-wide view of the silver station wagon entering from the left. The camera tracks forward with small amplitude at slow speed as the wagon travels toward a distant bend; sea mist drifts across the wet asphalt and the driver holds a steady course. At the final frame, the wagon reaches the foreground third of the road and its front wheels angle slightly toward the bend.\n\noverall_soundscape: Low engine hum, tires whispering over wet asphalt, close surf, light wind through roadside grass, and two distant gull calls.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Sparse felt-piano notes at a slow tempo with a quiet sustained cello tone and no rhythmic swell."],
